* ============================================================
* ALPHA_5_0_SHAKEDOWN_V32_V64_SPLIT.DTS
*
* Purpose:
*   Clean split shake-down for DotTalk++ v32 vs v64 environments.
*
* Goals:
*   1) Prove path separation is correct
*   2) Prove v32 does not accidentally drift into CDX/LMDB
*   3) Prove v64 resolves CDX + LMDB correctly
*   4) Collect regressions by batch, not by guesswork
*
* Notes:
*   - This script is intentionally repetitive.
*   - Repetition is preferred over ambiguous environment state.
*   - This is a shake-down, not a destructive rebuild script.
*   - Manual rebuild probes are at the end and commented out.
* ============================================================

SET ECHO ON
ECHO ===== ALPHA 5.0 SHAKE-DOWN START =====
COLOR DEFAULT
VERSION

* ============================================================
* SECTION 0 - HARD RESET / BASELINE
* ============================================================
ECHO ===== SECTION 0 - HARD RESET =====
SCHEMAS CLOSE
REL CLEAR ALL
SET ORDER TO 0
STATUS
WSREPORT

* ============================================================
* SECTION 1 - V32 ENVIRONMENT
* ============================================================
ECHO ===== SECTION 1 - V32 ENVIRONMENT =====

SETPATH DBF dbf
SETPATH INDEXES indexes\x32
SETPATH LMDB lmdb\v32
SET PATH

ECHO [V32 CHECK] WSREPORT should show DBF=dbf INDEXES=indexes\x32 LMDB=lmdb\v32
WSREPORT

ECHO [V32 CHECK] DIR indexes\x32
DIR indexes\x32

ECHO [V32 CHECK] open DBF flavor tables from v32 root
SCHEMAS CLOSE
REL CLEAR ALL
SCHEMAS OPEN DBF
SCHEMAS

* ------------------------------
* V32 / BUILDING
* ------------------------------
ECHO ===== V32 / BUILDING =====
SELECT BUILDING
AREA
STATUS
STRUCT
COUNT
RECNO
SMARTLIST 3
TOP
RECNO
SKIP 1
RECNO
BOTTOM
RECNO
TOP
RECNO

ECHO [V32 INDEX] Expect CNX/INX behavior only
SET INDEX TO building.cnx
AREA
SHOW INDEX
SET ORDER TO TAG BLDG
AREA
TOP
RECNO
SMARTLIST 3
SET ORDER TO 0
SHOW INDEX

* ------------------------------
* V32 / STUDENTS
* ------------------------------
ECHO ===== V32 / STUDENTS =====
SELECT STUDENTS
AREA
STATUS
STRUCT
COUNT
RECNO
SMARTLIST 5
TOP
RECNO

ECHO [V32 INDEX] Expect CNX/INX behavior only
SET INDEX TO students.cnx
AREA
SHOW INDEX
SET ORDER TO TAG LNAME
AREA
TOP
RECNO
SMARTLIST 5

ECHO [V32 SEEK / FIND / LOCATE]
LOCATE LNAME = Taylor
RECNO
TUPLE *
TOP
FIND Taylor
TOP
SEEK Davis
RECNO
TUPLE *

ECHO [V32 TAG SWITCH]
SET ORDER TO TAG FNAME
AREA
TOP
RECNO
SMARTLIST 5
SEEK Ava
RECNO
TUPLE *
SET ORDER TO TAG LNAME
TOP
RECNO

ECHO [V32 DATA TYPE TAGS]
SET ORDER TO TAG DOB
AREA
TOP
RECNO
SMARTLIST 5
SET ORDER TO TAG GPA
AREA
TOP
RECNO
SMARTLIST 5
SET ORDER TO 0
SHOW INDEX

* ------------------------------
* V32 / TEACHERS
* ------------------------------
ECHO ===== V32 / TEACHERS =====
SELECT TEACHERS
AREA
STATUS
STRUCT
COUNT
SMARTLIST 5

SET INDEX TO teachers.cnx
AREA
SHOW INDEX
SET ORDER TO TAG LNAME
AREA
TOP
RECNO
SMARTLIST 5
FIND WILSON
SEEK WILSON
RECNO
TUPLE *

ECHO [V32 DATE / NUMERIC TAGS]
SET ORDER TO TAG HIRE_DATE
AREA
TOP
RECNO
SMARTLIST 5
SET ORDER TO TAG TID
AREA
TOP
RECNO
SMARTLIST 5
SET ORDER TO 0
SHOW INDEX

* ------------------------------
* V32 / CLASSES
* ------------------------------
ECHO ===== V32 / CLASSES =====
SELECT CLASSES
AREA
STRUCT
COUNT
SMARTLIST 5

SET INDEX TO classes.cnx
AREA
SHOW INDEX
SET ORDER TO TAG CLS_ID
AREA
TOP
RECNO
SMARTLIST 5
SET ORDER TO TAG TID
AREA
TOP
RECNO
SMARTLIST 5
SET ORDER TO 0
SHOW INDEX

* ============================================================
* SECTION 2 - V32 REGRESSION BATCH NOTES
* ============================================================
ECHO ===== SECTION 2 - V32 REGRESSION BATCH NOTES =====
ECHO [BATCH V32-1] Path / attach failures
ECHO [BATCH V32-2] Navigation TOP/BOTTOM/SKIP
ECHO [BATCH V32-3] Ordered display SMARTLIST
ECHO [BATCH V32-4] SEEK / FIND / LOCATE
ECHO [BATCH V32-5] Date / Numeric tag behavior
ECHO [BATCH V32-6] STATUS / AREA / SHOW INDEX reporting

* ============================================================
* SECTION 3 - HARD RESET BEFORE V64
* ============================================================
ECHO ===== SECTION 3 - HARD RESET BEFORE V64 =====
SCHEMAS CLOSE
REL CLEAR ALL
SET ORDER TO 0
STATUS
WSREPORT

* ============================================================
* SECTION 4 - V64 ENVIRONMENT
* ============================================================
ECHO ===== SECTION 4 - V64 ENVIRONMENT =====

SETPATH DBF xdbf
SETPATH INDEXES indexes
SETPATH LMDB lmdb
SET PATH

ECHO [V64 CHECK] WSREPORT should show DBF=xdbf INDEXES=indexes LMDB=lmdb
WSREPORT

ECHO [V64 CHECK] DIR indexes
DIR indexes

ECHO [V64 CHECK] DIR lmdb
DIR lmdb

ECHO [V64 CHECK] open XDBF flavor tables from v64 root
SCHEMAS CLOSE
REL CLEAR ALL
SCHEMAS OPEN xDBF
SCHEMAS

* ------------------------------
* V64 / BUILDING
* ------------------------------
ECHO ===== V64 / BUILDING =====
SELECT BUILDING
AREA
STATUS
STRUCT
COUNT
RECNO
SMARTLIST 3
TOP
RECNO
SKIP 1
RECNO
BOTTOM
RECNO
TOP
RECNO

ECHO [V64 INDEX] Expect CDX + LMDB behavior
SET INDEX TO building.cdx
AREA
SHOW INDEX
SET ORDER TO TAG BLDG
AREA
TOP
RECNO
SMARTLIST 3
SET ORDER TO 0
SHOW INDEX

* ------------------------------
* V64 / STUDENTS
* ------------------------------
ECHO ===== V64 / STUDENTS =====
SELECT STUDENTS
AREA
STATUS
STRUCT
COUNT
RECNO
SMARTLIST 5
TOP
RECNO

ECHO [V64 INDEX] Expect CDX + LMDB behavior
SET INDEX TO students.cdx
AREA
SHOW INDEX
SET ORDER TO TAG LNAME
AREA
TOP
RECNO
SMARTLIST 5

ECHO [V64 SEEK / FIND / LOCATE]
LOCATE LNAME = Anderson
RECNO
TUPLE *
TOP
LOCATE LNAME = Taylor
RECNO
TUPLE *
TOP
FIND Taylor
TOP
SEEK Davis
RECNO
TUPLE *

ECHO [V64 TAG SWITCH]
SET ORDER TO TAG FNAME
AREA
TOP
RECNO
SMARTLIST 5
SEEK Ava
RECNO
TUPLE *
SET ORDER TO TAG LNAME
TOP
RECNO

ECHO [V64 DATA TYPE TAGS]
SET ORDER TO TAG DOB
AREA
TOP
RECNO
SMARTLIST 5
SET ORDER TO TAG GPA
AREA
TOP
RECNO
SMARTLIST 5
SET ORDER TO 0
SHOW INDEX

* ------------------------------
* V64 / TEACHERS
* ------------------------------
ECHO ===== V64 / TEACHERS =====
SELECT TEACHERS
AREA
STATUS
STRUCT
COUNT
SMARTLIST 5

SET INDEX TO teachers.cdx
AREA
SHOW INDEX
SET ORDER TO TAG LNAME
AREA
TOP
RECNO
SMARTLIST 5
FIND WILSON
SEEK WILSON
INDEXSEEK "WILSON"
RECNO
TUPLE *

ECHO [V64 DATE / NUMERIC TAGS]
SET ORDER TO TAG HIRE_DATE
AREA
TOP
RECNO
SMARTLIST 5
SET ORDER TO TAG TID
AREA
TOP
RECNO
SMARTLIST 5
SET ORDER TO 0
SHOW INDEX

* ------------------------------
* V64 / CLASSES
* ------------------------------
ECHO ===== V64 / CLASSES =====
SELECT CLASSES
AREA
STRUCT
COUNT
SMARTLIST 5

SET INDEX TO classes.cdx
AREA
SHOW INDEX
SET ORDER TO TAG CLS_ID
AREA
TOP
RECNO
SMARTLIST 5
SET ORDER TO TAG TID
AREA
TOP
RECNO
SMARTLIST 5
SET ORDER TO 0
SHOW INDEX

* ============================================================
* SECTION 5 - V64 REGRESSION BATCH NOTES
* ============================================================
ECHO ===== SECTION 5 - V64 REGRESSION BATCH NOTES =====
ECHO [BATCH V64-1] Path / attach failures
ECHO [BATCH V64-2] Metadata mismatch / wrong flavor attach
ECHO [BATCH V64-3] Navigation TOP/BOTTOM/SKIP
ECHO [BATCH V64-4] Ordered display SMARTLIST
ECHO [BATCH V64-5] SEEK / FIND / LOCATE / INDEXSEEK
ECHO [BATCH V64-6] Date / Numeric tag behavior
ECHO [BATCH V64-7] STATUS / AREA / SHOW INDEX / LMDB reporting

* ============================================================
* SECTION 6 - CROSS-CHECK / NO-GUESS OBSERVATIONS
* ============================================================
ECHO ===== SECTION 6 - CROSS-CHECK / NO-GUESS OBSERVATIONS =====

ECHO [OBSERVE] If v32 SET INDEX TO *.cnx tries to attach CDX/LMDB, routing is wrong.
ECHO [OBSERVE] If v64 SET INDEX TO *.cdx resolves but SET ORDER TO TAG fails with metadata mismatch, flavor/path pairing is wrong.
ECHO [OBSERVE] If AREA/STATUS/SHOW INDEX disagree on current order or index file, reporting is wrong.
ECHO [OBSERVE] If TOP/SEEK land on correct recno but SMARTLIST shows a different first row, cursor restore/display path is wrong.
ECHO [OBSERVE] If char tags work but date/numeric tags do not, collect under datatype normalization batch.

* ============================================================
* SECTION 7 - OPTIONAL MANUAL REBUILD PROBES
* Leave commented until you want destructive confirmation.
* ============================================================
ECHO ===== SECTION 7 - OPTIONAL MANUAL REBUILD PROBES =====
ECHO [MANUAL ONLY] Uncomment when ready:
ECHO   SELECT STUDENTS
ECHO   SET INDEX TO students.cnx
ECHO   REBUILD
ECHO   SET ORDER TO TAG LNAME
ECHO   SMARTLIST 5
ECHO
ECHO   SELECT STUDENTS
ECHO   SET INDEX TO students.cdx
ECHO   BUILDLMDB YES
ECHO   SET ORDER TO TAG LNAME
ECHO   SMARTLIST 5

* ============================================================
* SECTION 8 - CLEAN SHUTDOWN
* ============================================================
ECHO ===== SECTION 8 - CLEAN SHUTDOWN =====
SET ORDER TO 0
SCHEMAS
SCHEMAS CLOSE
ECHO ===== ALPHA 5.0 SHAKE-DOWN END =====
QUIT